<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάραγ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piece torn off, shred, fragment</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσων σπαράγματα</span> all whose <i>mangled
			corpses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1081
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάραγμα κόμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίνεται τὰ μὲν ἀπὸ
				σπέρματος τὰ δ᾽ ἀπὸ σπαραγμάτων</span> others from
				<i>slips</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				761b28
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κρημνῶν</span> jagged
				<i>fragments</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. στεφάνων</span>
			<i>fragments</i> of . ., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.463a
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμάτων σπαράγμασι . . οἱ
				σπεύδοντες γράφουσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1011d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tearing, rending</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμάλας διεφόρουν σπαράγμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					739
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> collect. in
			sg.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατύπη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				996.31
			</span></i> (Smyrna, prob. <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
